{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "f90c58b0ba50b83ccab7eb4cee967a543f41717037cd62de52a39e240c777a87", "ja": "わたしの知らない、キラキラ", "zh": "我不曾知晓的闪亮光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1f81e085f4c2b5e88f447ac4c1443e30f3c24f757d42a9db0d347c07d0df7236", "ja": "翼のレッスンは順調だが、レッスンルーム\nは連続して予約済み。言葉にうまくできない\nが、未来、静香、紬、歌織だったら続ける\nはずだからと答える。『本気』というものが\nなんなのか、翼なりに探し始めていた。", "zh": "翼的训练很顺利，但练习室已经被连续预约。她虽然没法很好地用语言表达，还是回答说，如果是未来、静香、紬和歌织的话，应该会继续下去。她开始以自己的方式寻找“认真”究竟是什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ee233c4e688abb3e1b4f4fb90da1523de64a464c4ca96ecb8efb948090633310", "ja": "第1回定期公演に向けたレッスン中……", "zh": "正在为第1次定期公演进行练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "344611bdd01872a8371ceec50583293aa35256865c309f1031d3dcdc1d69684a", "ja": "あっ、プロデューサーさんだ！\nお疲れさまでーす♪", "zh": "啊，是制作人！\n辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "7cb2841ec81ff3c47655d58b77530a198278f6b14736a6be9c01cb6744fbb776", "ja": "お疲れさま翼。\nレッスン、順調みたいだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，翼。看样子练习进行得很顺利？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5cef8dececb0e28302b3ab7692d08abaa283cb8825df8f77ccd86ab18c5332ef", "ja": "そうですね～。初日の曲は歌詞もフリも、\nぜんぶ覚えたかも。", "zh": "是啊～。第一天要唱的歌，歌词和舞步我可能全都记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "22b84bbc94d9adfd0d95238b1d93984c80d770e4c8c067a73e13aa2bf3af3221", "ja": "うん！　……えっ、もう？", "zh": "嗯！……诶，已经记住了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "de438fcabcb9e3d82b831e296b83ef27e2a2b90e8bfb122a5ee0482a71978a25", "ja": "うん、この前のリハでなんとなく掴めたから。\nさっき通しでやってみたら、出来ちゃった感じ。", "zh": "嗯，因为在之前的彩排中多少掌握了一点感觉。\n刚才试着完整排练了一遍，感觉就这样做到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "797f1d2f39e276161cea168946c0fc6c10eecd027d5e1973acc52ca6c53dd5e0", "ja": "そ、そっか。まだ本番までだいぶあるのに。\nさすがだな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。明明离正式演出还早着呢。\n真不愧是你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e8e416e9caeca2f310ef8cac3742a9d82a0fa946199103509b9ed27a957e5ba2", "ja": "そう？　……あ、それよりプロデューサーさん、\nわたしにはキラキラしたお仕事、来てないんですか？", "zh": "是吗？……啊，比起这个，制作人先生，\n最近没有什么闪闪发光的工作找上我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "ec390bad6b8547329b8a8a78b53fb97c7973b6ff0b2c3d3885fe09925957dfca", "ja": "？　キラキラしたお仕事？", "zh": "？闪闪发光的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "44e46036aaf9b8e30477ed649697ba7fe04cfce0d73e10632c57aaefb7904af2", "ja": "ほら！　茜ちゃんが配信でプチバズして、\nCMのお仕事もらってましたよね？", "zh": "你看！小茜在直播里小火了一把，还接到了广告的工作，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3173f315010f974ff92886b6c2fcfbeea90495bbf8a2c14b0937cca77b2440f", "ja": "可憐さんはファッション雑誌に載ってて……\nああいうの、すっごくいいな～って♪", "zh": "可怜小姐也上了时尚杂志……\n那种感觉，真的好棒呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "a41b65dd19a44ea13977f892a662ef910bec415c1f02f8629b9768ca2dcc3a45", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……。残念だけど、\n今のところ、そういうオファーは来てないかな？", "zh": "啊，原来如此……。真遗憾，\n不过目前还没有收到那种工作邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "0f0c6ca775a7cfad02db65c9e353da1d370989781070cce4de36f0bcb6c183ea", "ja": "でも、そういう仕事が翼の希望だって覚えておくよ。\n今はまず、地道に実績を積み重ねていこう！", "zh": "不过，我会记住，那种工作是翼的愿望。\n现在还是先脚踏实地地积累经验吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "447467784f1cea4b9e6cc8e1d1f36acac89383f2e901d34a44de44650d6024b4", "ja": "え～、地道ってどれぐらい？\n途中でご褒美とかあるといいな～。", "zh": "诶～，一步一个脚印要多久呀？\n要是中途能有点奖励什么的就好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "b066040bd924f51a981e734a8afcfa5ebaaa4ff8d08f4dc89c52c572f20d10d3", "ja": "あ、いや、だから、\nご褒美は希望のオファーというか……。", "zh": "啊，不是，我是说，\n奖励就是理想的邀约之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d347560f1a99715a37e9426cfc0e6ef327f7a2862fe8b8231630cbed69c6c4ea", "ja": "む～。オーディションの時の\nデートの約束も、まだなのに～。", "zh": "唔～。试镜时的\n约会约定，也还没兑现呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "e5ecaf1e985231aef1410171f2a561aa9cc309161421625198356c54583e1422", "ja": "え？　いや、あれは……！　っと、もうレッスンルーム\nの予約が切り替わるな。続きは別の場所で……。", "zh": "诶？不是，那是……！啊，练习室的预约马上就要切换了。接下来的话去别的地方再说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "ca578a115fff6a1d684fdd297af91683d0819dd543520c97fcac6b2829aa4a49", "ja": "ん？　あれ？　次の予約も翼になってるけど……？", "zh": "嗯？咦？下一个预约也是翼的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ff30b5f7d8df2106fa7506110a271c3225ab0d3bc6b792acf4991f72bf1c1255", "ja": "あっ、そうそう。\nわたしが続けて予約入れたんです、さっき。", "zh": "啊，对了对了。\n刚才是我连续预约的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "730bd91614bdd191667d314ac6ea0c252cde9a1bd1c936dcc99242d2d3d37916", "ja": "？　自分のレッスンは、\nほとんど終わってるんだろ？", "zh": "你的课程不是已经差不多结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "69e50bc92e2a74e362c61719e38e4550343c41ba4a652bb3ca16671d0138f13e", "ja": "そうなんですけど、まだ全然疲れてなくて。\nそれに……みんなならもっと続けるかな～と思って。", "zh": "是这样没错，可我还完全不觉得累。\n而且……我在想，要是大家的话，应该还会继续练习吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e06b66046d4dbeacd712de13f46edf9d43d2a64167199e8c3152f318cb881eca", "ja": "未来も、静香ちゃんも……。\n紬さん、歌織さんでも。", "zh": "未来也是，静香也是……  \n就连紬小姐和歌织小姐也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "062688efa66874ad4aa195672a66c07495bf6f2c4d92737422c89b39c0ec75a0", "ja": "へえ……。\n4人のことが気になるのか？", "zh": "哦……你是在意4个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "76abc4d42efaa9651d1ebe9297306142f38ae62431ceda8892d53c85c9660a44", "ja": "んー。気になるっていうか。\n負けたくないっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯——与其说是在意，倒不如说……是不想输给她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b5ad1c3c5fbda62d8e4daead63e72fcd3f6d49860cd89cc2bf6b6a32ff1ccee2", "ja": "とにかく、置いて行かれたりするのは、\n絶対イヤだなって。", "zh": "总之，我绝对不想被丢下不管。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5567271ea479d3f3233ca1a4f337f166ef474ec4353b0789c8d6eb79c11ba962", "ja": "だから函館の時も、こけら落とし公演でも、\n思いっきりやってみて。そしたら……。", "zh": "所以函馆那次也好，开幕公演也好，都尽情去做吧。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f1cd0deba7ccb3f9c6c65f847f1545b9fe876fbffe6b6de70b656daf0d51fdad", "ja": "ステージからの景色がキラキラで……。\n終わってからもフワフワして、ドキドキしたの。", "zh": "从舞台上看到的景色闪闪发光……\n结束之后也一直飘飘然的，心里怦怦直跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "83eb2f753f4f8e5ffcd68dc7a930443357d88a08a91f5833c0a837550d12e7e4", "ja": "……うん。そっか。", "zh": "……嗯，这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27eabcf8b72c2589ce2f84769e6de04af79b4f2aef1f62b8b8813abdad6b40db", "ja": "でも、ツラい練習とかは\nやっぱりイヤだな～って。", "zh": "不过，辛苦的训练什么的，果然还是不想做啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "3220ecf9ab37511ec62f1b5d9eb1d88def0fa9a850c458ea2088601b45db921a", "ja": "……う、うん。そっか！", "zh": "……嗯、嗯。这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3d7c5e10c252788b59dac3da094bbabfcb6ac589f83bf9fc249bcfb282336e8f", "ja": "……。ねえ、プロデューサーさん。\n本気って、何だと思います？", "zh": "……制作人。\n你觉得，认真到底是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "c5f9f322d8b19214d23d09ce3d52d0c212ca0599d87362de42858216dbabaa1a", "ja": "え？　ええっと、そうだな。\n何かに全力をつくすとか、夢中になること……。", "zh": "诶？这个嘛，让我想想。\n全力以赴去做某件事，或者全身心投入其中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "ca516493b33817abe6b302316b500c7f5b54b270e89346c93af097ac1294b98c", "ja": "いや。……違うか。", "zh": "不。……不对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "d90dfea79d168165911f5275cbbfe9918a252cfcf1d384ed383fce4d2ed76413", "ja": "たぶん……本気かどうか、気にならなくなること。\nそれが本気になるってことだと思う。", "zh": "大概……就是不会再在意是不是真心。\n我觉得，这才叫认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f6abe6cb254d48a76f3d1ec494a06acbbc3293016359febfbcb2eea76883d89", "ja": "気にならなくなること……？\nう～、やっぱりよくわかんない～！", "zh": "变得不再在意……？\n呜～，果然还是不太明白～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1aee25fe69fa92cb27a6b30bc9405da3ab45c1c2165a01d4493a04c8d9d830e0", "ja": "まぁ、いっか。\nアイドルしてたら、そのうちわかりますよね？", "zh": "嘛，无所谓啦。\n继续做偶像的话，总有一天会明白的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1037_401pro", "source_sha256": "ce4674a9c1baa8e14b179887cd0796e9157a720fd09a8a196c9d600f85192d91", "ja": "……ははっ、そうだな。\nうん、翼なら絶対わかると思う！", "zh": "……哈哈，也是呢。\n嗯，我觉得是翼的话一定能明白的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1038_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b59f3357b8090713632852b8b935782391d7b6d10ec926a76abc3b3991e797e", "ja": "よし、それじゃ……翼、最近気になってるカフェとか、\nあったりしないか？", "zh": "好，那就……翼，你最近有没有什么\n挺在意的咖啡厅？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "15505046d5ff278902464d92b32d9d4d79a0eec046ee5dafd43362ec7eee9e5b", "ja": "え、カフェ？\nもちろんありますけど、どうして？", "zh": "诶，咖啡厅？\n当然有啊，不过为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1040_401pro", "source_sha256": "a96972ec261c7dd46ef9a908e9bfb7967786221a42570c2a3adda70f1eada2bf", "ja": "次の打ち合わせはそこでしようと思って。\n遅くなったけど、オーディションのお礼だよ。", "zh": "我想下次就在那边开会。\n虽然有点晚了，但这是对试镜的感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4272e479566c128231d124b245a1c3979272803ed58acad0c3f0bac1ea3eb11b", "ja": "えっ、連れてってくれるの！？\nやったー！　プロデューサーさん、だーい好き♪", "zh": "诶，要带我一起去吗！？\n太好了——！制作人，我最喜欢你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "80c169989ffa453cbccbfba516b405f90be817a9e7ebf3db16c65403182d6903", "ja": "コホン！　その代わり、今は頑張ること！\nせっかくレッスンルームの予約とったんだし。な？", "zh": "咳咳！所以我们也不要各自为战，\n而要大家齐心协力！一起努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23ba1be3f9562a7dc5128e0ecfbe77d8f87ceb43373172d839efa4169bca0514", "ja": "もちろんでーす♪　じゃあ、せっかくだから、\nプロデューサーさんも見ててくださいね！", "zh": "那当然啦～♪ 那么，机会难得，\n制作人也请看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_03_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "75c8962347f90abc88129909a1bcaf36f6a878d40e1b6b1a5f2caff7356d21e0", "ja": "今日も、今度のデートの時も♪　これから、わたしが\nアイドルしてる時は、ずーーっと！　……えへへっ♪", "zh": "今天也好，下次约会的时候也好♪ 今后，只要我当偶像，就一直一直看着我哦！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
